This is a fork of gitlab.com/elixxir/client/v4 at tag v4.8.4 (commit 92631c67),
published as gitlab.com/keith16/client and tagged v4.8.5-courier.0. The module
path is kept canonical (gitlab.com/elixxir/client/v4). It adds 11 functional
commits used by the Courier client engine: gateway pool observability and
reselection, cMix send-reliability instrumentation and too-late-round skipping,
two channels lease-machinery bug fixes, and device-side channel mention pings.

The modifications are contributed under the same BSD 2-Clause license as the
original, so the combined work may be merged upstream with no relicensing.

See FORK.md for the full change list and how to inspect the exact diff.
